{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_rally","model_identifier":"spell_rally","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_rally\n\nSupport-mage rally: a burst of red-gold sparks rising from the ground in a 6 m circle (radius 107 u) with a small upright flare at the centre.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -109..109, y 0..30, z -109..109 units (6.11 x 0.84 x 6.11 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 65.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 217 x 30 x 217 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `burst` | 1.4 | once | sparks shoot up in three waves (to 60-90 u), the centre flare springs up and holds; ring stays on the ground |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_flare, glow_flare_core, glow_flare_x, glow_ground0, glow_ground1, glow_ground10, glow_ground11, glow_ground12, glow_ground13, glow_ground14, glow_ground15, glow_ground16 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"glow_flare","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,0.0,-2.0],"to":[2.0,24.0,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[2.0,0.0,6.0,24.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2.0,0.0,6.0,24.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[2.0,0.0,6.0,24.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[2.0,0.0,6.0,24.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28.0,30.0,32.0,34.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[2